          "script": "\tuser\u003dself.session.props.auth.user.userName\n\ttagpath\u003d[\"WOCL_1/Downtime/Ideal_time/Start_time\",\"Current_Shift/shift_ID\"]\n\ttagvalue\u003dsystem.tag.readBlocking(tagpath)\n\treasondowntime\u003d37\n\tuser\u003dself.session.props.auth.user.userName\n\tinprogressdowntime\u003dFalse\n\tstarttime\u003dtagvalue[0].value\n\tshift\u003dtagvalue[1].value\n\tdescdowntime\u003d\u0027\u0027\n\tparameters \u003d { \"ReasonID\":reasondowntime, \"DowntimeStatus\":not inprogressdowntime,\"username\":user,\"StartTime\":starttime,\"ShiftID\":shift,\"DowntimeSource\":1,\"Remarks\":descdowntime}\n\tidreturn\u003dsystem.db.runNamedQuery(\"Hitachi_Energy_Transformer\",\"downtime/insert\", parameters)\n\tlogId\u003didreturn.getValueAt(0,\"LogID\")\n\tsystem.tag.writeBlocking(tagPaths\u003d[\"WOCL_1/Downtime/Ideal_time/logID\"], values\u003d[logId])\n\tsystem.perspective.logout()",
